{"id":649,"date":"2021-02-09T22:08:50","date_gmt":"2021-02-09T22:08:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/?page_id=649"},"modified":"2023-08-14T11:20:32","modified_gmt":"2023-08-14T11:20:32","slug":"adult-merchant-accounts","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/adult-merchant-accounts\/","title":{"rendered":"Adult"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0);background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color:#e2e2e2;border-style:solid;\" id=\"sticky-sidebar-container\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-justify-content-center\" style=\"max-width:1216.8px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_2_3 2_3 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1610562965139 para-black\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<h2><strong>Merchant Account for Adult Businesses<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Online sales are the cornerstone of many adult businesses. As a result, choosing the right adult business payment processor can greatly impact the bottom line. Choose wrong, and your profits get eroded by fees. Or even worse, you can\u2019t process payments and revenue screeches to a halt. Choose right, and you can securely and reliably process payments online without breaking the bank.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Of course, finding the right adult business payment processor takes some work. You\u2019ll need to understand what to look for and consider your unique needs. Generally, the right adult merchant accounts will come with lower processing fees and fewer service hassles.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To help you find the right adult business payment processor for your needs, this article will take a closer look at adult e-commerce and what merchants in the industry need to know about payment processing. We\u2019ll also explain why using systems like PayPal, Stripe, or Square as an adult business payment processor is risky<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Examples of Adult e-Commerce Businesses<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before we go any further, let\u2019s classify what makes a business an \u201cadult business\u201d. While there\u2019s no one-size-fits-all answer, here are some popular adult business categories:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dating and escort services<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pornographic websites<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adult toys and games<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adult bookstores<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adult clothing and lingerie stores<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adult massage businesses<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strip clubs<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Generally, any business that offers a product or service focused on sex and other adult content can be categorized as an adult business. If you\u2019re unsure if your business is an adult business and need a payment solutions provider, <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/signup.tailoredpay.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">contact TailoredPay for help<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Selling Adult Products Online Often Makes Your Business \u201cHigh Risk\u201d<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choosing the right adult business payment processor has a major impact on your business.It can even be the difference between a successful and unsuccessful adult business. Unfortunately, adult businesses are often classified as \u201chigh risk, &#8221; complicating payment processing.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Often traditional payment processors will overcharge or deny service to adult businesses. In many cases, a <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/high-risk-merchant-account\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">high risk merchant account<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is often the only viable option for adult businesses.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Is being a \u201chigh risk\u201d adult business a problem?<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It depends. Traditional banks and processors like PayPal, Stripe, or Square often choose not to offer payment solutions to adult businesses because of the perceived risk. For example:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cAdult products and services\u201d is listed in <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/squareup.com\/au\/en\/townsquare\/square-keeps-businesses-safe#:~:text=Adult%20products%20or%20services\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Square\u2019s Unsupported Industries list<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cAdult content and services\u201d is listed in <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/stripe.com\/legal\/restricted-businesses#:~:text=Adult%20content%20and%20services\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stripe\u2019s Prohibited Businesses list<\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.paypal.com\/us\/cshelp\/article\/what-is-paypal%E2%80%99s-policy-on-transactions-that-involve-sexually-oriented-goods-and-services-help384#:~:text=Sexually%20oriented%20digital%20goods%20or%20content%20delivered%20through%20a%20digital%20medium.%20Examples%20of%20digital%20goods%20include%20downloadable%20pictures%20or%20videos%20and%20website%20subscriptions.\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">PayPal<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> does not permit account holders to sell sexually oriented digital content<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">High risk merchant account providers like <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">TailoredPay<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are willing to work with adult businesses when traditional providers aren\u2019t. As long as your business is legal, you can find merchants that will work with your payment processing needs.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why are adult businesses considered high risk?<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adult businesses are age-restricted. It is also a controversial industry, causing many leading payment processors to avoid working with adult businesses. Everyone has their opinion on the topic, but why is it considered high risk for payment processing? There are various factors, with the industry&#8217;s reputation and chargebacks being two of the biggest contributors.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In part, adult businesses are high risk due to their reputation. It\u2019s an unfortunate reality that not every adult site operates legally or ethically. For big providers, it&#8217;s easier to avoid the industry altogether than to navigate the risk of servicing legitimate adult businesses. Additionally, adult businesses are often prone to chargebacks that can chew away at profit margins.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chargebacks Can Be Costly for Adult Businesses\u00a0<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chargebacks are also a major concern for adult merchants. Chargebacks are often a result of fraud. They can also be the fault of merchants who don&#8217;t understand their consumers and are simply part of the subscription sales model to some extent. The right processor can help mitigate the risk of chargebacks. High-powered alerts and detection systems are vital in reducing chargeback risk in the adult industry.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>The TailoredPay difference<\/b><\/p>\n<p>TailoredPay leverages Verifi\u2019s CDRN (Cardholder Dispute Resolution Network) and Ethoca\u2019s alert system to help adult businesses <a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/chargeback-mitigation\/\">mitigate chargeback risk<\/a> and save money.<\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding the Right Adult Business Payment Processor<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding the right merchant can be confusing. Sure, online options like Stripe may always approve you. But once you start processing payments, they will underwrite your account. Then you will soon realize that the actual processor is important, not who approves you. Working with a merchant specializing in adult business adds a sense of security.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Accepting credit and debit card payments isn&#8217;t a bonus, it&#8217;s a necessity in today&#8217;s market. Choosing the right company can be hard, but choosing one with your best interest at heart is worthwhile.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Partner with TailoredPay for the best payment solutions in the industry<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Payment processing for adult businesses comes with a complex set of challenges. At\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">TailoredPay<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we\u2019re experts in helping high risk businesses \u2014 like adult businesses \u2014 find the payment solutions they need without breaking the bank. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We focus on right-sizing adult business merchant accounts and terms that enable your business to scale. Adult businesses that partner with TailoredPay gain:<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Affordable and transparent rates\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Opportunity for approval even if other providers have rejected you<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Powerful <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/chargeback-mitigation\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">chargeback mitigation<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Industry expertise that right size your payment processing<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019d like to get started, complete <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/signup.tailoredpay.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">this simple form<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and we\u2019ll get back to you within 24 hours!<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder